# Offline authentication failure with real dispatch; no model response is mocked.
name: Expired OAuth refuses inference and preserves investigation accounting
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-6-luna
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/oauth_expiry.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | context-picker
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | context-form
keys: t
require-live-snap: 15 Total calls | total-editor
type: 8
keys: Enter
keys: r
require-live-snap: 15 Protected review | review-editor
type: 2
keys: Enter
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Draft ready | context-draft
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-end
expect: Total provider calls: 8
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 approved | approved-context
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | unstarted-job
keys: L
require-live-snap: 20 dispatcher pid | started-dispatcher
wait: 3
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 threat-model:build · failed | failed-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/oauth_expiry.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does failed authentication stay separate from a completed context job, with no claim of a generated Map?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | result
expect: Provider authentication failed.
ask: Does the context result explain the authentication failure and preserve the source job and its unconsumed call allowance?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: result-small-paged
ask: Are failure evidence and recovery controls reachable at 40x12 without launching another attempt?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 remain recorded. | result-small-last
ask: Can the complete result be read to its final retained-spending guidance while keeping the recovery controls visible?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 15 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-confirmation
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-6-luna
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/open-context.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 threat-model:build · failed | restored-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | restored-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/oauth_expiry.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does a real no-color restart retain the failed attempt and unused allowance without retrying authentication or creating a Map?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
